flowchart TD
    P[Select one of five phases] --> T[Select phase-specific template]
    T --> B[Build dependency or causal blueprint]
    B --> E[Embed blueprint into board geometry]
    E --> M[Assign multi-cell, obstacle, gate, switch roles]
    M --> V[Static validation]
    V -->|fail| R[Reject and retry deterministic seed]
    V --> S[Hybrid solve]
    S -->|unsolvable/inconclusive| R
    S --> X[Replay trace]
    X -->|fail| R
    X --> A[Difficulty analysis]
    A --> Q{Inside phase target band?}
    Q -->|No and no approved exception| R
    Q -->|Yes| C[Accept candidate and record manifest]
    C --> O[Generate runtime catalog + reports]
